    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration, Adventure, and Mystery in an Open World!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to uncover the deepest secrets of nature? <strong>Wild Explorer</strong> invites you into a world of discovery, survival, and mystery. From remote forests to ancient ruins, every corner hides a new story. Prepare your camera, follow the traces of nature, and reveal forgotten secrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Realistic Photography Mechanics</strong><br>Capture the rarest animals and historic monuments in the wild, adding them to your explorer\u2019s journal. Improve your observation skills, seize the perfect moment, and complete your discovery book!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/1c0d1659b8b86ded0bdb7bf840da8024.poster.avif?t=1752886463\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/1c0d1659b8b86ded0bdb7bf840da8024.webm?t=1752886463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/1c0d1659b8b86ded0bdb7bf840da8024.mp4?t=1752886463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26fa <strong>Manage Time and Survive</strong><br>Time is in your hands! <strong>Rest in your tent</strong> to turn night into day, explore in the darkness, or use daylight to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/019a7f89615a958e22b0de79173083c8.poster.avif?t=1752886463\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/019a7f89615a958e22b0de79173083c8.webm?t=1752886463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/019a7f89615a958e22b0de79173083c8.mp4?t=1752886463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Vast Open World and Map Navigation</strong><br>From treacherous swamps to shadowy forests, abandoned temples to towering peaks\u2026 Each region has its own ecosystem and hidden mysteries! Use the map carefully to avoid losing your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/6c546619f4b4a7df9cb41743970efe38.poster.avif?t=1752886463\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/6c546619f4b4a7df9cb41743970efe38.webm?t=1752886463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/6c546619f4b4a7df9cb41743970efe38.mp4?t=1752886463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f <strong>Interact with NPCs and Discover Hidden Clues</strong><br>Talk to mysterious characters in the area to learn the locations of lost monuments. Your choices shape your adventure, and every discovery brings you closer to great secrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/a675a8e451cdefdaa0fb9c10f8bbf57e.poster.avif?t=1752886463\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/a675a8e451cdefdaa0fb9c10f8bbf57e.webm?t=1752886463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/a675a8e451cdefdaa0fb9c10f8bbf57e.mp4?t=1752886463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Ancient Relics and Forgotten Legends</strong><br>The forest holds more than just nature\u2014<strong>traces of forgotten civilizations</strong> await! The <strong>Legendary Sword</strong>, lost tombs, and tales from the depths of history are waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/d58aa8873ce490f92ffa0efdd5214387.poster.avif?t=1752886463\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/d58aa8873ce490f92ffa0efdd5214387.webm?t=1752886463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/d58aa8873ce490f92ffa0efdd5214387.mp4?t=1752886463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to become a true explorer?</strong><br>\ud83d\udcf8 Explore, document your findings, and reveal nature\u2019s greatest mysteries!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration, Adventure, and Mystery in an Open World!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to uncover the deepest secrets of nature? <strong>Wild Explorer</strong> invites you into a world of discovery, survival, and mystery. From remote forests to ancient ruins, every corner hides a new story. Prepare your camera, follow the traces of nature, and reveal forgotten secrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Realistic Photography Mechanics</strong><br>Capture the rarest animals and historic monuments in the wild, adding them to your explorer\u2019s journal. Improve your observation skills, seize the perfect moment, and complete your discovery book!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/1c0d1659b8b86ded0bdb7bf840da8024.poster.avif?t=1752886463\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/1c0d1659b8b86ded0bdb7bf840da8024.webm?t=1752886463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/1c0d1659b8b86ded0bdb7bf840da8024.mp4?t=1752886463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26fa <strong>Manage Time and Survive</strong><br>Time is in your hands! <strong>Rest in your tent</strong> to turn night into day, explore in the darkness, or use daylight to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/019a7f89615a958e22b0de79173083c8.poster.avif?t=1752886463\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/019a7f89615a958e22b0de79173083c8.webm?t=1752886463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/019a7f89615a958e22b0de79173083c8.mp4?t=1752886463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Vast Open World and Map Navigation</strong><br>From treacherous swamps to shadowy forests, abandoned temples to towering peaks\u2026 Each region has its own ecosystem and hidden mysteries! Use the map carefully to avoid losing your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/6c546619f4b4a7df9cb41743970efe38.poster.avif?t=1752886463\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/6c546619f4b4a7df9cb41743970efe38.webm?t=1752886463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/6c546619f4b4a7df9cb41743970efe38.mp4?t=1752886463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f <strong>Interact with NPCs and Discover Hidden Clues</strong><br>Talk to mysterious characters in the area to learn the locations of lost monuments. Your choices shape your adventure, and every discovery brings you closer to great secrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/a675a8e451cdefdaa0fb9c10f8bbf57e.poster.avif?t=1752886463\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/a675a8e451cdefdaa0fb9c10f8bbf57e.webm?t=1752886463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/a675a8e451cdefdaa0fb9c10f8bbf57e.mp4?t=1752886463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Ancient Relics and Forgotten Legends</strong><br>The forest holds more than just nature\u2014<strong>traces of forgotten civilizations</strong> await! The <strong>Legendary Sword</strong>, lost tombs, and tales from the depths of history are waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/d58aa8873ce490f92ffa0efdd5214387.poster.avif?t=1752886463\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/d58aa8873ce490f92ffa0efdd5214387.webm?t=1752886463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/d58aa8873ce490f92ffa0efdd5214387.mp4?t=1752886463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to become a true explorer?</strong><br>\ud83d\udcf8 Explore, document your findings, and reveal nature\u2019s greatest mysteries!</p>",
    "short_description": "Wild Explorer takes you on an immersive journey deep into the wild. Capture stunning photos of wildlife, explore ancient monuments, and uncover hidden secrets. Use your torch to navigate the darkness and complete your exploration book with every discovery. Are you ready for the adventure?",
